WEBVTT

00:00:26.956 --> 00:00:31.076
but to January 21, 2021,

00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:33.476
when I received an email

00:00:33.516 --> 00:00:37.756
about a curious discovery made
in Rutland in the Midlands.

00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:41.196
As a paleontologist,
you can probably imagine,

00:00:41.196 --> 00:00:44.836
I get countless messages and emails
from people saying,

00:00:44.876 --> 00:00:47.196
"Oh, we've made a cool fossil discovery."

00:00:49.356 --> 00:00:53.356
Being completely honest, most of the time,

00:00:53.396 --> 00:00:56.516
it turns out to be, well,
a weird shaped rock,

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.636
(Laughter)

00:00:58.636 --> 00:01:03.716
But, little did I know this email
would change my life.